217	    /**
218	     * Derive an owner's membership points: start at 0; add 2 when an email address is present; add 1
219	     * when the owner has no namesakes (namesakeCount is 0); add 2 when the owner belongs to a
220	     * household of 3 or more (see {@link #hasHouseholdBonus(Owner)}); add 3 when the owner's tenure
221	     * is at least one elapsed fiscal year (see {@link #hasTenureBonus(Owner)}). Because a newly
222	     * created owner has zero tenure it never earns the tenure points, so a new owner with an email
223	     * and no namesakes in a single-member household scores 3 points.
224	     */
